A `tags.yaml` that does not map strings to strings is one `tags` error on the file, and no
record's tags are checked against it.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/tags.yaml --
- ui
- net
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/value/0001-audio.md --
---
type: value
title: Audio
summary: The Audio value.
kind: value
created_by: owner
created_at: 2026-01-01
updated_at: 2026-01-01
tags: [audio]
---

Why the project exists.

## In practice

It shows in every run.
-- cmd --
booping specs check
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
vault/tags.yaml:1  error  tags  tags.yaml must map each tag to a one-line description
-- stderr --
1 record(s) checked: 1 error(s), 0 warning(s)
